This licence applies to three files of this directory, and to nothing else in
the repository: the interface between Agentic-Datacenter and a system from
elsewhere, so that anyone may implement it, copy it into their own tests and
ship it with their own work.

  gate-http-v1.schema.json     the wire format
  mandate-statements.md        the rule for signed mandate statements
  mandate-vectors.json         its test vectors

